# Naomi 2 Club Kart FFB effect settings

# set the global strength of all effects here (0-100)
GLOBAL_GAIN 100

# set the strength during intialization phase, when wheel goes completely right (to the Base=0, then search for the enter)
# For logitech G27, you can set INITIALIZATION_GAIN 160
INITIALIZATION_GAIN 160

# for the games not supporting FFB effects, you can set a generic auto center effect here (0-100)
AUTO_CENTER 0

# adjust spring effect if necessary here
MIN_SPRING 10
MAX_SPRING 100

# adjust friction effect if necessary here
MIN_FRICTION 10
MAX_FRICTION 100

# adjust torque effect if necessary here
MIN_TORQUE 10
MAX_TORQUE 100

# adjust sine effect intensity if necessary here (default is 0-100)
MIN_INTENSITY 10
MAX_INTENSITY 100

LOGITECH_STEERING_RANGE 270

